Subject: [PATCH 153/220] [ae-patch] Blur what is behind the slash command and
 file mention menus

The dark theme's popover colour is 80% opaque and neither the slash command menu nor the @ file mention menu had a backdrop blur, so the chat text behind them showed through the rows. Both now use the frosted surface other popovers use (backdrop-blur-xl, backdrop-saturate-150). Light themes are solid and unchanged.
